code: 0
--- stdout
Work is stuck: waiting for another issue or an outside decision

  From:      In progress, Changes requested
  To:        the status is not changed
  Refused:   while the issue has the label blocked (exit code 2): ask the user
             resume removes it
  Requires:  at least one of --by, --comment
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Labels:    +blocked (+ adds, - removes)
  Blockers:  --by naming issues (12, #12, owner/repo#12 or URLs, comma-separated) also marks this one blocked by them; a pull request is only named in the comment
             free text in --by goes into the comment as is: on an issue of another repository,
             GitHub links a #N in it to that issue's repository, not to the default one
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               On hold until {by}.

               {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo hold <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --by string        value for {by} in the comment: issues (12, #12, owner/repo#12 or URLs, comma-separated), also marked as blocking this one, or free text
      --comment string   text for {comment} in the comment
      --dry-run          print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help             help for hold

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)
--- stderr
